"Allow closing the session when some invoices are in draft because their CFE "
"was not validated in DGI."
msgstr ""
"Permite cerrar la sesión cuando hay facturas en borrador porque DGI no "
"validó su CFE."

#. module: l10n_uy_edi_pos_ux
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_uy_edi_pos_ux.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Before paying, ask for an identified customer when the sale exceeds the "
